 default position that you live in Murder is not the default position that people live in An overwhelming majority of the people are living their life So, the reality is, we're living in a state of bliss in most situations", "and then there is an existence of Evil within that life of goodness So, it is not that the whole world.. As some people try to put it That's the first thing I'm going to say second thing I'm going to say is that Evil is relative something might be bad for you but good for me for instance, we talked about sickness, if I'm sick, sickness is not necessarily the best for me but it's good for the doctor, you know? The doctor is probably going to get out of business.. there's no more business if I don't get sick and you don't get sick That is good for him, but it is not good for me That good and bad is very..", "it's relative to the individual and relative to the situation you have someone going and gambling, losing all his money but the other person won all his money So, maybe it's bad for you, you have a terrible day, evil day but the other person has a fantastic day, he made a lot of money Evil can be relative if you look at the bigger picture that same evil can be good for someone else",))
