n The Preserved Tablet. That knowledge is just written down in a text form. That's the second level. Also the third level is the Creation. That Allah created everything. Allah created us. Allah created the things that we do. Allah created everything. So everything is created by Allah there is nothing that is not created by Allah Allahﷻ says (Azzumar39:62) ٱللَّهُ خَـٰلِقُ كُلِّ شَیۡءࣲۖ (Allah is the Creator of everything) Heavens and the Earth, the mountains, everything like this is created by Allah.", "And the fourth level is the Will. That everything happens under Allah's Will Since the Creator is All-Powerful, All-Knowing, there cannot be something happening in His Dominion that is not in accordance to His Will. Therefore the Creator would not be All-Powerful If I'm living under your dominion, and I'm doing things that are against your will and it is not your will that these things are happening, then by definition you're not an all-knowledgeable, all-powerful creator, because you're not able to stop me from doing things against your will. I'm doing things that oppose your will. So everything that happens in the Dominion of Allah happens under Allah's Will, and these are the four stages of Qadar. So believing in these four things is an obligation on every Muslim that you have to believe in these four stages.",))
